    "noteA": {"x": 2400, "y": 0, "w": 340, "size": "m", "fill": "orange", "text": "A · Warm boutique. Plum and marigold on warm bone. Bricolage Grotesque headings, Figtree text. Soft rounded cards, pill buttons. Meant to feel like a good salon."},
    "noteB": {"x": 2400, "y": 2208, "w": 340, "size": "m", "fill": "gray", "text": "B · Clean premium. Near-black on white, one green that only ever means money. Geist throughout, hairline rules, big tabular numbers, lots of space. Meant to feel like Apple or Linear."},
    "noteC": {"x": 2400, "y": 4416, "w": 340, "size": "m", "fill": "red", "text": "C · Bold modern. Pepper red and lime colour blocks, heavy Archivo, thick black outlines, huge numbers. Energetic, like Cash App."},
    "howTo": {"x": 2400, "y": -300, "w": 340, "size": "m", "fill": "teal", "text": "Same shop, same morning in all three: Southside Cuts, Chicago, Tue Oct 27, barbers Dre and Randy. Press Play on any phone and tap through: tabs, Why?, Approve, Undo, and the booking flow. The booking page uses the shop's own teal; Pepper's look shows only in its frame and footer."}
